<!doctype html><html lang="my"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><title><%= r.request_no %></title><style><%- css %></style></head><body><main class="print-sheet"><header class="report-heading"><div><div class="brand">INNOCREATION</div><h1>Warehouse Purchase Request</h1><p>Main Warehouse</p></div><div class="report-ref"><strong><%= r.request_no %></strong><p><%= r.created_at instanceof Date?r.created_at.toLocaleString('en-GB',{timeZone:'Asia/Bangkok'}):r.created_at %> · Asia/Bangkok</p></div></header><p>Requested by: <%= r.requested_name||'—' %></p><table class="report-items"><thead><tr><th>Item Code</th><th>Material</th><th>Requested Qty</th><th>Unit</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><%= r.item_code %></td><td><%= r.item_name %></td><td><%= r.qty %></td><td><%= r.unit %></td></tr></tbody></table><section class="report-remark"><strong>Request-time stock snapshot</strong><p>Stock: <%= r.stock_snapshot %> <%= r.unit %> · Min / Reorder Qty: <%= r.reorder_snapshot %> <%= r.unit %></p></section><section class="report-remark"><strong>Remark</strong><p><%= r.remark||'—' %></p></section><p class="posting-note">မူလ Warehouse Request Qty ဖြစ်ပါသည်။ Supplier ဆီမှာယူသော PO Qty နှင့် ကွာခြားနိုင်ပါသည်။</p><footer class="report-footer">INNOCREATION · Warehouse Purchase Request</footer></main></body></html>
